  "04 Final Notice": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 ring-2 ring-turquoise"><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-turquoise text-white">4</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Final Notice</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">ADVISER</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#FFF3E0] text-[#A16207] ">Current</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Give the owner written notice at least 30 days before any recovery action. No action can be taken for levies covered by a payment plan that is being followed</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Before any recovery action, give the owner written notice at least 30 days ahead. No action can be taken for levies covered by a payment plan that is being followed. Not confirmed: the prescribed content of this notice and the clause that requires it. Check both before issuing.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">NSW Government guidance on the changes from 27 Oct 2025</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Complete this step</p><div><label class="mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Outcome / Notes</label><textarea rows="3" placeholder="Describe what was done and the outcome of this step..." class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-turquoise focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-turquoise"></textarea></div><div><label class="mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Notice Sent Via</label><select class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-turquoise focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-turquoise"><option value="">Select method...</option><option value="EMAIL">Email</option><option value="POST">Post</option><option value="REGISTERED_POST">Registered Post</option><option value="HAND_DELIVERY">Hand Delivery</option></select></div><div><label class="mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Evidence / Supporting Notes</label><textarea rows="2" placeholder="Reference any evidence or supporting documentation..." class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-turquoise focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-turquoise"></textarea></div><div role="group" aria-label="StrataVerze fee" class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink space-y-2"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-medium">StrataVerze fee: Debt recovery step: final notice</p><p class="font-semibold tabular-nums">$33.00 <span class="font-normal text-ink-muted">incl. GST</span></p></div><p class="text-ink-muted">StrataVerze charges a flat fee for this debt recovery step. The owners corporation may recover it from the owner in arrears.</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Charged to the owners corporation and recoverable from the owner in arrears (SSMA s 86). $30.00 plus $3.00 GST. <a class="underline hover:text-ink" target="_blank" href="/adviser/schemes/nsw-1/finance/platform-fees#fee-schedule">View the fee schedule</a></p><label for="fee-confirm-RECOVERY_STEP-step-04" class="flex items-start gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input id="fee-confirm-RECOVERY_STEP-step-04" class="mt-0.5" type="checkbox"><span>I understand StrataVerze will charge $33.00 (incl. GST) for this.</span></label></div><div class="flex justify-end"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " disabled="">Complete Final Notice</button></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise "><svg class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg>Previous Step</button><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Step 4 of 10</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise ">Next Step<svg class="h-4 w-4 ml-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap=