  "07 Legal Referral": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-gray-100 text-gray-400">7</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Legal Referral</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">ADVISER</span><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-amber-700">Approval Required</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Refer the matter to a solicitor with the ledger, notices, evidence of service and the authorising decision</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Refer the matter to a solicitor with the ledger, the levy notices, the 30-day notice, evidence of service and the decision authorising proceedings.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">SSMA 2015 s 86</p></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4 text-center"><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">This step will become available once the preceding steps are completed.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-ce