te opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100">Committee Review</span></button><button class="group relative flex-1 h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-gray-200 " title="Legal Referral"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded bg-gray-900 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-white opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100">Legal Referral</span></button><button class="group relative flex-1 h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-gray-200 " title="Proceedings"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded bg-gray-900 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-white opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100">Proceedings</span></button><button class="group relative flex-1 h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-gray-200 " title="Enforcement"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded bg-gray-900 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-white opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100">Enforcement</span></button><button class="group relative flex-1 h-2 rounded-full transition-all bg-gray-200 " title="Closed"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 whitespace-nowrap rounded bg-gray-900 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] text-white opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-100">Closed</span></button></div><div class="mt-2 hidden sm:flex items-start gap-1"><button class="flex-1 text-center text-[10px] leading-tight transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600">Ledger Verification</button><button class="flex-1 text-center text-[10px] leading-tight transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600">Initial Contact</button><button class="flex-1 text-center text-[10px] leading-tight transition-colors text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600">Reminder Notice</button><button class="flex-1 text-center text-[10px] leading-tight transition-colors text-turquoise font-medium">Final Notice</but