  "03 Reminder Notice": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700"><svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Reminder Notice</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">ADVISER</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#E6F7F3] text-[#1A7A63] ">Completed</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Send a written reminder showing the unpaid contributions, any penalty and any recovery costs separately</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Send a written reminder showing the unpaid contributions, any penalty and any recovery costs separately. Owners are shown penalty, never interest. No period for a reminder is set by law, so the building sets its own. This reminder is StrataVerze practice.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">StrataVerze practice. Penalty: Standard Module s 165</p></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg border border-emerald-100 bg-emerald-50/50 p-4 space-y-2"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-emerald-700">Completed 20 Oct 2026</p><div><p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-medium">Outcome</p><p class="text-sm text-emerald-800">REMINDER_NOTICE done</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-emerald-600 font-medium">Evidence</p><p class="text-sm text-emerald-800">Evidence for REMINDER_NOTICE</p></div><p class="text-xs text-emerald-600">Notice sent via registered post on 20 Oct 2026</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise "><svg class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg>Previous Step</button><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Step 3 of 10</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise ">Next Step<svg class="h-4 w-4 ml-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></button></div>",
  "04 Final Notice": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 ring-2 ring-turquoise"><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-turquoise text-white">4</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Final Notice</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">ADVISER</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#FFF3E0] text-[#A16207] ">Current</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Tell the owner in writing that the body corporate may start proceedings to recover the unpaid contributions, the penalty and recovery costs reasonably incurred</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Tell the owner in writing that the body corporate may start proceedings to recover the unpaid contributions, the penalty and recovery costs reasonably incurred. Recovery may start once a contribution is unpaid by the date for payment. The research notes record no notice that must be given before proceedings, so this notice is StrataVerze practice.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">StrataVerze practice. Recovery as a debt: Standard Module s 166(1)</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">Complete this step</p><div><label class="mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Outcome / Notes</label><textarea rows="3" placeholder="Describe what was done and the outcome of this step..." class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-turquoise focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-turquoise"></textarea></div><div><label class="mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Notice Sent Via</label><select class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-turquoise focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-turquoise"><option value="">Select method...</option><option value="EMAIL">Email</option><option value="POST">Post</option><option value="REGISTERED_POST">Registered Post</option><option value="HAND_DELIVERY">Hand Delivery</option></select></div><div><label class="mb-1 block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">Evidence / Supporting Notes</label><textarea rows="2" placeholder="Reference any evidence or supporting documentation..." class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-sm focus:border-turquoise focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-turquoise"></textarea></div><div role="group" aria-label="StrataVerze fee" class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink space-y-2"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-medium">StrataVerze fee: Debt recovery step: final notice</p><p class="font-semibold tabular-nums">$33.00 <span class="font-normal text-ink-muted">incl. GST</span></p></div><p class="text-ink-muted">StrataVerze charges a flat fee for this debt recovery step. It may be recoverable from the owner if reasonably incurred (Standard Module s 166(1)(c)).</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Charged to the body corporate and may be recoverable from the owner if reasonably incurred (Standard Module s 166(1)(c)). $30.00 plus $3.00 GST. <a class="underline hover:text-ink" target="_blank" href="/adviser/schemes/qld-1/finance/platform-fees#fee-schedule">View the fee schedule</a></p><label for="fee-confirm-RECOVERY_STEP-step-04" class="flex items-start gap-2 cursor-pointer"><input id="fee-confirm-RECOVERY_STEP-step-04" class="mt-0.5" type="checkbox"><span>I understand StrataVerze will charge $33.00 (incl. GST) for this.</span></label></div><div class="flex justify-end"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " disabled="">Complete Final Notice</button></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise "><svg class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg>Previous Step</button><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Step 4 of 10</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise ">Next Step<svg class="h-4 w-4 ml-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></button></div>",
  "05 Waiver Request": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-gray-100 text-gray-400">5</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Waiver Request</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-purple-50 text-purple-700">COMMITTEE</span><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-amber-700">Approval Required</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">If the owner asks, decide whether there are special reasons to waive the penalty or recovery costs, in whole or in part. A request can arrive at any step</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">If satisfied there are special reasons, the body corporate may waive the penalty or recovery costs, in whole or in part, or allow the discount for paying on time (Standard Module s 166(6)). There is no hardship statement and no statutory payment plan in Queensland. Treating a request as a step is StrataVerze practice. Not confirmed: whether the committee can decide a waiver or a general meeting resolution is needed.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">StrataVerze practice. Waiver for special reasons: Standard Module s 166(6)</p></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4 text-center"><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">This step will become available once the preceding steps are completed.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise "><svg class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg>Previous Step</button><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Step 5 of 10</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise ">Next Step<svg class="h-4 w-4 ml-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></button></div>",
  "06 Committee Review": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-gray-100 text-gray-400">6</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Committee Review</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-purple-50 text-purple-700">COMMITTEE</span><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-amber-700">Approval Required</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Decide whether to start proceedings to recover the debt. If a contribution has been unpaid for 2 years, proceedings must start within 2 months after the end of the 2 years</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">The committee can decide to start proceedings to recover a liquidated debt from a lot owner (Standard Module s 52(1)(e)(i)). If a contribution has been outstanding for 2 years, the body corporate must start proceedings within 2 months after the end of the 2 years (Standard Module s 166(2)). The debt recovery page warns when a lot reaches this point. How the 2 years is counted is StrataVerze's reading: from the date for payment of the oldest unpaid contribution.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">Standard Module ss 52(1)(e)(i), 166(2)</p></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4 text-center"><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">This step will become available once the preceding steps are completed.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise "><svg class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg>Previous Step</button><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Step 6 of 10</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise ">Next Step<svg class="h-4 w-4 ml-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></button></div>",
  "07 Legal Referral": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-gray-100 text-gray-400">7</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Legal Referral</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-blue-50 text-blue-700">ADVISER</span><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-amber-700">Approval Required</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Refer the matter to a solicitor, or prepare the claim, with the ledger, the contribution notices and the committee's decision</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">Refer the matter to a solicitor, or prepare the claim, with the ledger, the contribution notices and the committee's decision. The owner when the debt became payable and a later owner, including a mortgagee in possession, are jointly and severally liable (Standard Module s 166(3), (4)). Recovery costs reasonably incurred are recoverable (Standard Module s 166(1)(c)). Government guidance gives legal fees and body corporate manager arrears notice fees as examples. Not confirmed: whether any particular cost beyond that, including a StrataVerze fee, is recoverable from the owner.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">StrataVerze practice. Recovery costs reasonably incurred: Standard Module s 166(1)(c)</p></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4 text-center"><p class="text-sm text-gray-400">This step will become available once the preceding steps are completed.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise "><svg class="h-4 w-4 mr-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 19.5 8.25 12l7.5-7.5"></path></svg>Previous Step</button><p class="text-xs text-gray-400">Step 7 of 10</p><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none text-ink-muted hover:text-ink hover:bg-muted focus:ring-turquoise ">Next Step<svg class="h-4 w-4 ml-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 4.5 7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5"></path></svg></button></div>",
  "08 Proceedings": "<div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="p-5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><div class="flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full text-sm font-bold bg-gray-100 text-gray-400">8</div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Proceedings</h3><div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium bg-gray-50 text-gray-700">SOLICITOR</span></div></div></div></div><div class="mb-4 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 p-4"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">What to do</p><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Start proceedings to recover the debt: a claim in QCAT as a minor civil dispute for up to $25,000, or a claim in a court. An adjudicator cannot decide a debt dispute</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500">A claim to recover a debt of up to $25,000 is a minor civil dispute in QCAT. The body corporate may instead claim in a court. An adjudicator cannot decide a debt dispute (BCCMA s 229A). Once QCAT or court proceedings start, any dispute resolution process for the debt ends. Not confirmed: the Magistrates Court limit for debts over $25,000. Rely on the solicitor's advice.</p></div><div class="mb-4 flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50/50 p-3"><svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-blue-500 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 0 0 6 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 1 6 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 0 1 6-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0 0 18 18a8.967 8.967 0 0 0-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"></path></svg><div><p class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Legal Basis</p><p class="text-xs text-blue-600">BCCMA s 229A. QCAT Act sch 3</p></div></div><div class="rounde