ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Total Owing</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-red-600">$1,235.50</p></div></div><div class="pt-2 border-t border-line"><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Notes</p><p class="text-sm text-ink whitespace-pre-wrap">Called twice</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Recovery Steps</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">NSW Strata Schemes Management Act 2015 recovery process.</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><ol class="relative border-l-2 border-line ml-3 space-y-4"><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-500"><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-muted"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted">1. Ledger Verification</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Check each overdue levy was validly raised and its notice served with the hardship information, and that payments were applied to the oldest levies first, then interest, then costs (unless the owner or a court or tribunal order directed otherwise)</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">SSMA 2015 ss 83, 85; payment order: NSW Government guidance (from 27 Oct 2025)</p></div><span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">20 Oct 2026</span></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1">Outcome: LEDGER_VERIFICATION done</p></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-500"><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-muted"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted">2. Initial Contact</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Contact the owner about the overdue levies: the amount owing, and that they can ask for a payment plan on the standard form</p></div><span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">20 Oct 2026</span></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1">Outcome: INITIAL_CONTACT done</p></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-500"><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-muted"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted">3. Reminder Notice</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Send a written reminder showing levies, interest and any costs separately, with the hardship information and how to ask for a payment plan</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">Interest: SSMA 2015 s 85</p></div><span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">20 Oct 2026</span></div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1">Outcome: REMINDER_NOTICE done</p></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-turquoise bg-turquoise"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-turquoise/5 border border-turquoise/20"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-turquoise">4. Final Notice</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Give the owner written notice at least 30 days before any recovery action. No action can be taken for levies covered by a payment plan that is being followed</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">NSW Government guidance on the changes from 27 Oct 2025</p></div></div><div class="mt-2 space-y-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise ">Mark Complete</button></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">5. Hardship Review</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Decide any payment plan request (and any request to waive interest) by majority vote at an owners corporation or strata committee meeting, recorded in the minutes, and reply in writing within 28 days. A refusal must give reasons. No fee can be charged. A request can arrive at any step</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">Strata Schemes Management Regulation 2016 cl 17K (Form 1); NSW Government guidance</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">6. Committee Review</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Decide whether to start recovery proceedings, after the 30-day notice has expired and with no payment plan being followed</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">7. Legal Referral</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Refer the matter to a solicitor with the ledger, notices, evidence of service and the authorising decision</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">SSMA 2015 s 86</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">8. Proceedings</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Solicitor starts proceedings to recover the unpaid levies as a debt</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">SSMA 2015 s 86</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">9. Enforcement</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Solicitor enforces the judgment or order</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">10. Closed</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Close the case and reconcile the lot ledger</p></div></div></div></li></ol></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Documents</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Notices and documents related to this case.</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><div class="space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-muted px-4 py-3"><div><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Reminder</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">REMINDER LETTER · 5 Oct 2026</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Add Note</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Record an observation or update for this case.</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-3"><textarea placeholder="Enter a note..." rows="3" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise/40"></textarea><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " disabled="">Add Note</button></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Activity Log</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Recent activity on thi