  "debtor": "<div class="space-y-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8"><div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-ink-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors mb-2" href="/owner/levies/debt-recovery"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12L6 8L10 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>Back to Cases</a><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ink mb-1">Case DR-2026-0001</h1><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">View your debt recovery case details.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Case Overview</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Opened 1 Oct 2026</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full h-[22px] px-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap bg-[#FFF3E0] text-[#A16207] ">In Progress</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-red-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-red-700">High Priority</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-blue-700">Waiver Request</span></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4"><div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Principal</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink">$1,200.00</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Penalty</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink">$35.50</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Costs</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-ink">$0.00</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Total Owing</p><p class="text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-red-600">$1,235.50</p></div></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Recovery Steps</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Qld Body Corporate and Community Management Act 1997 recovery process.</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6"><ol class="relative border-l-2 border-line ml-3 space-y-4"><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-500"><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-muted"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted">1. Ledger Verification</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Check each unpaid contribution was fixed and its contribution notice given at least 30 days before the date for payment, and that payments were applied first to the penalty, then to the contribution, then to recovery costs</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice. Contribution notice: Standard Module s 163. Payment order: Standard Module s 166(5)</p></div><span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">20 Oct 2026</span></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-500"><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-muted"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted">2. Initial Contact</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Contact the owner about the unpaid contributions and the amount owing, including any penalty</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice</p></div><span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">20 Oct 2026</span></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-green-500 bg-green-500"><svg class="h-2.5 w-2.5 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="3" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"></path></svg></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-muted"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink-muted">3. Reminder Notice</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Send a written reminder showing the unpaid contributions, any penalty and any recovery costs separately</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice. Penalty: Standard Module s 165</p></div><span class="shrink-0 text-xs text-ink-muted">20 Oct 2026</span></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-turquoise bg-turquoise"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-turquoise/5 border border-turquoise/20"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-turquoise">4. Final Notice</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Tell the owner in writing that the body corporate may start proceedings to recover the unpaid contributions, the penalty and recovery costs reasonably incurred</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice. Recovery as a debt: Standard Module s 166(1)</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">5. Waiver Request</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">If the owner asks, decide whether there are special reasons to waive the penalty or recovery costs, in whole or in part. A request can arrive at any step</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice. Waiver for special reasons: Standard Module s 166(6)</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">6. Committee Review</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Decide whether to start proceedings to recover the debt. If a contribution has been unpaid for 2 years, proceedings must start within 2 months after the end of the 2 years</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">Standard Module ss 52(1)(e)(i), 166(2)</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">7. Legal Referral</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Refer the matter to a solicitor, or prepare the claim, with the ledger, the contribution notices and the committee&#x27;s decision</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice. Recovery costs reasonably incurred: Standard Module s 166(1)(c)</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">8. Proceedings</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Start proceedings to recover the debt: a claim in QCAT as a minor civil dispute for up to $25,000, or a claim in a court. An adjudicator cannot decide a debt dispute</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">BCCMA s 229A. QCAT Act sch 3</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">9. Enforcement</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Enforce the order or judgment</p></div></div></div></li><li class="ml-6"><span class="absolute -left-[9px] flex h-4 w-4 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-line bg-white"></span><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] p-3 bg-white"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-2"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">10. Closed</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Close the case and reconcile the lot ledger</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted italic mt-0.5">StrataVerze practice</p></div></div></div></li></ol></div></div></div></div>",
  "debtorReads": [
    "DebtRecoveryActivity",
    "DebtRecoveryCase",
    "DebtRecoveryDocument",
    "DebtRecoveryStep",
    "PaymentPlan",
    "Scheme",
    "SchemeMembership",
  ],
}
`;

